y related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "People's Personalities"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use adjectives to describe people's personalities: how a person usually acts or behaves.     "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Adjectives can be placed after the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use this structure:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + be + adjective  <br /><span class=\"italic\">He/Someone who + is + hard working.</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Personality Words</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hard working <br />responsible <br />funny <br />caring <br />kind <br />nice\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We are looking for someone who is cordial."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We're looking for someone who is hard working and responsible. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Someone with a winning personality! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We aren't looking for an underperformer. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to volunteer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do a job without getting any money "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I volunteer at the library."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to describe people's personalities. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hardworking "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "working with a lot of effort "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are looking for someone who is hardworking."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "responsible "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to trust and do what is right "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are very responsible. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "winning "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " pleasing to other people "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want someone with a winning personality!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "decision "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a choice you make after thinking about it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When we make a decision, I'll call you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cordial "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "friendly and polite "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  You are cordial. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le08ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "underperformer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who does not work as hard as they can"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "co